":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/3ababbe90ecac767f185b11b25c0d47518b3a4b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-18T07:25:42Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-18T07:25:42Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Improve Navigator pane with recursive file listing and proper org lookup\n\nNavigator Pane Improvements:\n- Add recursive file listing to pre-load all folder contents on startup\n- Add loading skeleton animation during initial file fetch\n- Change initial isLoading state to true to prevent \"No files yet\" flash\n- Add lazy loading fallback for folder expansion\n\nDatabase & Storage:\n- Add getUserOrgId() function to query user''s organization from database\n- Remove hardcoded ''dev-org'' fallback, properly query org membership table\n- Add listFilesRecursive() method to storage adapter interface\n- Implement recursive listing in both S3 and local storage adapters\n\nAPI Updates:\n- Add recursive=true query parameter to /api/files/list endpoint\n- Update user-storage.ts to query DB when ORG cookie is missing\n- Update chat.ts to query DB for org when x-org-id header is missing\n\nS3 Public Assets:\n- Upload Pixell logos to S3 bucket (paf-org-public-public)\n- Configure public read access for /assets/* path\n- Logo URL: https://paf-org-public-public.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/assets/logos/\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a5343b75ec782c2639473f81fa1b41610a6d757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/3a5343b75ec782c2639473f81fa1b41610a6d757"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/3ababbe90ecac767f185b11b25c0d47518b3a4b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/3ababbe90ecac767f185b11b25c0d47518b3a4b8","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDNhYmFiYmU5MGVjYWM3NjdmMTg1YjExYjI1YzBkNDc1MThiM2E0Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/3056ff67e9071968268a75be1b784f44ee363e06","sha":"3056ff67e9071968268a75be1b784f44ee363e06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/3056ff67e9071968268a75be1b784f44ee363e06"}],"sha":"3ababbe90ecac767f185b11b25c0d47518b3a4b8","ur