/4cf2fd49d0d9afb4a9ff7da3b4c6254554979eeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-25T03:42:23Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-25T03:42:23Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat(oauth): Add OAuth API routes for external account management\n\nImplement API routes for OAuth external account operations:\n\nUser-facing routes (session auth):\n- GET/DELETE /api/oauth/accounts - List/disconnect accounts\n- POST /api/oauth/accounts/default - Set default account\n- POST /api/oauth/accounts/auto-approve - Update auto-approve\n- POST /api/oauth/tiktok/callback - Handle TikAPI OAuth callback\n\nInternal routes (service token auth):\n- GET/POST /api/oauth/token - Get tokens for PAF Core Agent\n\nFeatures:\n- Plan gating (Pro/Max only for external connections)\n- Account ownership verification before modifications\n- Token validation before retrieval\n- Service token authentication for internal API\n\nAdds supabase-auth helper for session handling in routes.\nIncludes 11 unit tests for route structure validation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8253b02f755f782290966d5d5b4d9a11a19e3814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/8253b02f755f782290966d5d5b4d9a11a19e3814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/4cf2fd49d0d9afb4a9ff7da3b4c6254554979eeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}"