hub.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/d2f07f3091b886bde25985ef330fe98ec9de2b71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-25T03:04:44Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-25T03:04:44Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat(oauth): Add external accounts manager for CRUD operations\n\nImplement ExternalAccountsManager class for managing OAuth accounts:\n- connectAccount: Create or update connected accounts\n- getAccountsForOrg: List accounts without exposing tokens\n- getAccountById: Get single account by ID\n- getDecryptedToken: Securely retrieve token (internal use)\n- getDefaultAccount: Get default account for provider\n- disconnectAccount: Soft delete account\n- setDefaultAccount: Change default account for provider\n- updateAutoApprove: Toggle auto-approve setting\n- markTokenError/clearTokenError: Track token issues\n- validateToken: Verify token with provider\n\nFeatures:\n- Automatic default account selection for first account\n- Token encryption/decryption via encryption module\n- Last used timestamp tracking\n- Error state management\n\nUpdates jest.setup.js to mock uuid module.\nIncludes 22 unit tests for interface validation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a76f583180d2db8ffe2dbde014d81915a234584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/3a76f583180d2db8ffe2dbde014d81915a234584"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/d2f07f3091b886bde25985ef330fe98ec9de2b71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent