.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/4a6982dfe84a88a76eb9754d01d5540bd1d6a1f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T11:20:19Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T11:20:57Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat(billing): Implement subscription reconciliation and payment system improvements\n\n## Backend Changes\n- Add subscription reconciliation Lambda worker (packages/workers/subscription-reconciliation/)\n- Fix reconciliation to check organization''s stripe_customer_id as fallback\n- Add auto-topup API endpoint for automatic credit purchase\n- Add create-free subscription endpoint for new user onboarding\n\n## Frontend Changes\n- Update billing UI to display current plan tier and credits\n- Improve subscription status display with cancel_at_period_end handling\n- Add Firebase session management improvements\n- Remove deprecated admin user delete endpoint\n\n## Database\n- Update schema with stripe_customer_id on organizations table\n- Add proper typing for subscription reconciliation\n\n## Infrastructure\n- Remove shell scripts from source control (security)\n- Update .gitignore to exclude build artifacts, credentials, and test files\n- Clean up deployment scripts and Lambda build artifacts\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34893554a29a4edd83810c33059238f5a6014253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/34893554a29a4edd83810c33059238f5a6014253"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/4a6982dfe84a88a76eb9754d01d5540bd1d6a1f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconte