_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/e898da7741e33179a63ccece9852354e76225e1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-16T09:36:03Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-16T09:36:03Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Add database migration runner scripts and complete production migrations\n\nAdded migration utilities:\n- scripts/run-migration.js - Robust migration runner supporting both Drizzle and standard SQL formats\n- scripts/check-db-tables.js - Quick database table listing utility\n\nProduction database migration completed:\n- Successfully migrated vivid_prod database from 0 to 17 tables\n- All 6 billing tables created: subscriptions, billable_actions, credit_balances, credit_purchases, webhook_events, invoices\n- Base schema tables: organizations, users, brands, teams, and access control tables\n- Migration runner handles comment filtering, statement splitting, and retry scenarios\n\nFeatures:\n- Automatic Drizzle breakpoint detection and conversion\n- Single-line (--) and multi-line (/* */) comment removal\n- Duplicate error handling for idempotent migrations\n- Progress tracking and detailed error reporting\n- Production safety warnings with 3-second countdown\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f48cceed4b2a37b1c0c6adcbd68505cfeab149ba","url":"https://api.github.