ps://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/e89da9986a836fde4ee90bb7b215f382ba9565f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:37:13Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:37:13Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive S3 storage architecture and AWS IAM setup documentation\n\n- STORAGE_ARCHITECTURE.md: Complete architecture guide with diagrams, API usage examples, scaling considerations, cost optimization, monitoring, security, and backup/recovery procedures\n- AWS_IAM_SETUP.md: Detailed IAM setup guide with policies, step-by-step instructions for users/roles, verification scripts, security best practices, and troubleshooting\n\nThese docs complete Steps 9-10 of the S3-only per-org implementation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37ba33c23b7f3b48792e1f430ae830241b86ca8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/37ba33c23b7f3b48792e1f430ae830241b86ca8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/e89da9986a836fde4ee90bb7b215f382ba9565f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/e89da9986a836fde4ee90bb7b215f382ba9565f7","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKGU4OWRhOTk4NmE4MzZmZGU0ZWU5MGJiN2IyMTVmMzgyYmE5NTY1Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db","sha":"f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db"}],"sha":"e89da9986a836fde4ee90bb7b215f382ba9565f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/e89da9986a836fde4ee90bb7b215f382ba9565f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:33:13Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:33:13Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive end-to-end integration tests\n\nStep 8: E2E test scenarios for complete workflow validation\n\n## Test Scenarios (8 scenarios, 18 tests)\n\n**Scenario 1: New Organization - Complete Workflow**\n- Auto-bucket creation\n- File upload → list → read → delete cycle\n- Verifies basic CRUD operations\n\n**Scenario 2: Multi-User Isolation**\n- Two users in same organization\n- Each user only sees their own files\n- Verifies user-level isolation\n\n**Scenario 3: Team Context - Shared Files**\n- Team members can share files\n- Folder creation in team context\n- Verifies team collaboration\n\n**Scenario 4: Brand Context - Asset Management**\n- Brand assets isolated from user files\n- Multiple asset uploads\n- Verifies brand-specific storage\n\n**Scenario 5: Shared Context - Organization-Wide**\n- Org-wide shared documents\n- Accessible to all org members\n- Verifies shared file access\n\n**Scenario 6: Multiple Organizations - Complete Isolation**\n- Two different organizations\n- Separate buckets per org\n- Verifies org-level isolation\n\n**Scenario 7: File Versioning - Delete Recovery**\n- Multiple file versions\n- Deletion doesn''t remove versions\n- Verifies versioning is enabled\n\n**Scenario 8: Large File Upload**\n- 5MB file upload test\n- Verifies large file handling\n- Tests upload performance\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\n# Run E2E tests (requires AWS credentials)\nRUN_S3_INTEGRATION_TESTS=true npm test -- e2e.test.ts\n\n# Or run all tests\nRUN_S3_INTEGRATION_TESTS=true npm test\n```\n\n## Test Coverage\n- ✓ Bucket auto-creation\n- ✓ All 4 context types (user/team/brand/shared)\n- ✓ Multi-user isolation\n- ✓ Multi-org isolation\n- ✓ File versioning\n- ✓ Large file uploads\n- ✓ CRUD operations\n- ✓ Folder creation\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be60e7e5b437c2f66cfc43bcbbac3c36ecfa26df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/be60e7e5b437c2f66cfc43bcbbac3c36ecfa26df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKGY1ZDM0Nzc4ZmZiNjI5ZDg4ZmZhZjRiMjhjNTNmM2RlYzdhMzI1ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54","sha":"fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54"}],"sha":"f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/f5d34778ffb629d88ffaf4b28c53f3dec7a325db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:14:56Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:14:56Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Convert to S3-only storage (remove local/supabase)\n\nSteps 5 & 6: Enhanced error handling + S3-only mode\n\n## S3-Only Conversion\n- Removed local storage adapter support\n- Removed Supabase storage adapter support\n- Hardcoded provider to ''s3'' in StorageManager\n- Added validation requiring AWS credentials\n- Simplified buildStorageConfigForOrg() - no provider checks\n- Simplified buildStorageConfigForContext() - S3-only\n\n## Enhanced Error Handling\n- Clear error message when AWS credentials missing\n- Helpful IAM permission messages on AccessDenied\n- Improved error context in all S3Adapter methods\n- Graceful handling of concurrent bucket creation\n- Detailed logging for bucket configuration steps\n\n## Breaking Changes\n- STORAGE_PROVIDER env var now ignored (always S3)\n- AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID and AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY required\n- Local filesystem storage no longer available\n- Supabase storage no longer available\n\n## Benefits\n- Simpler codebase (one storage backend)\n- Consistent production-ready infrastructure\n- Better error messages for AWS setup\n- Reduced dependencies\n- Clearer deployment requirements\n\n## Security Features Retained\n✓ Versioning enabled for file recovery\n✓ AES-256 encryption at rest\n✓ Public access completely blocked\n✓ Per-organization bucket isolation\n\nNote: Lifecycle policies temporarily disabled due to TypeScript\ncompatibility issues. Can be re-enabled via AWS Console.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"545d4de5136d56b01d4d00d0ec3aa981e72deee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/545d4de5136d56b01d4d00d0ec3aa981e72deee6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKGZiMzI3YzE0MTdiYTA3MjVhY2U1ODRhMWY4YjE1MjhkODIwY2RmNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/79a69208cfa8b5e55f46ffa4315b40945a242673","sha":"79a69208cfa8b5e55f46ffa4315b40945a242673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/79a69208cfa8b5e55f46ffa4315b40945a242673"}],"sha":"fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/fb327c1417ba0725ace584a1f8b1528d820cdf54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/79a69208cfa8b5e55f46ffa4315b40945a242673/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:12:21Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:12:21Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Update file API routes to support multi-context storage\n\nStep 4: All file APIs now support users/teams/brands/shared contexts\n\n## Updated Routes\n- /api/files/list: Context-aware file listing\n- /api/files/create: Create files in specific contexts\n- /api/files/content: Read files from specific contexts\n- /api/files/delete: Delete files in specific contexts\n\n## API Changes\nAll routes now accept query parameters:\n- context: ''user'' | ''team'' | ''brand'' | ''shared'' (default: ''user'')\n- contextId: Required for team/brand contexts\n\n## Examples\n- List user files: GET /api/files/list\n- List team files: GET /api/files/list?context=team&contextId=team-123\n- Create brand asset: POST /api/files/create?context=brand&contextId=brand-456\n- Read shared file: GET /api/files/content?path=/doc.pdf&context=shared\n\n## Benefits\n- User file isolation by default\n- Team collaboration support\n- Brand asset management\n- Organization-wide shared files\n- Backward compatible (defaults to user context)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d514a708316872bf9e50c898b2658db4e607c34f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/d514a708316872bf9e50c898b2658db4e607c34f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/79a69208cfa8b5e55f46ffa4315b40945a242673","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"com