","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/1366d20612058a06bac577f120f215f14ffa6701/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:10:18Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:10:18Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Add multi-context storage path resolution\n\nStep 3: Support for users/teams/brands/shared contexts\n\n## Multi-Context Storage System\n- Created StorageContext type system with 4 contexts:\n  * user: Private files per user (users/{userId}/workspace-files)\n  * team: Shared team files (teams/{teamId}/shared)\n  * brand: Brand assets (brands/{brandId}/assets)\n  * shared: Organization-wide files (shared/)\n\n- Implemented buildStoragePrefix() for S3 path generation\n- Implemented parseStorageContext() for path parsing\n- Added canAccessContext() placeholder for future auth\n\n## Enhanced Path Resolution\n- Added buildStorageConfigForContext() to workspace-path.ts\n- Supports both local and S3 storage with context-aware prefixing\n- Maintains backward compatibility with buildStorageConfigForOrg()\n- All paths follow pattern: orgs/{orgId}/{context}/{id}/\n\n## Test Coverage\n- Comprehensive unit tests for all context types\n- Tests for path parsing and validation\n- Tests for public (unauthenticated) user contexts\n\n## Next Steps\n- Update API routes to use multi-context (Step 4)\n- Implement proper authorization checks in canAccessContext()\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2adf128e6bb6bc6c1cd219580cd6ee10ca52cae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/2adf128e6bb6bc6c1cd219580cd6ee10ca52cae4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/1366d20612058a06bac577f120f215f14ffa6701","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/1366d20612058a06bac577f120f215f14ffa6701","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDEzNjZkMjA2MTIwNThhMDZiYWM1NzdmMTIwZjIxNWYxNGZmYTY3MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896","sha":"768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896"}],"sha":"1366d20612058a06bac577f120f215f14ffa6701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/1366d20612058a06bac577f120f215f14ffa6701"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:08:14Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T02:08:14Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"feat: Implement S3 bucket auto-creation with security best practices\n\nStep 1 & 2: Test infrastructure and auto-bucket creation\n\n## Test Infrastructure (Step 1)\n- Created comprehensive unit test suite for S3Adapter\n- Created integration test suite for real S3 operations\n- Added test utilities for bucket generation and data mocking\n- Configured Jest for file-storage package\n- Added test scripts: test, test:unit, test:integration, test:coverage\n\n## Auto-Bucket Creation (Step 2)\n- Implemented ensureBucketExists() to check/create buckets\n- Implemented createBucket() with full security configuration:\n  ✓ Versioning enabled for file recovery\n  ✓ AES-256 encryption at rest\n  ✓ Public access completely blocked\n  ✓ Lifecycle policies (Glacier after 30 days, delete after 90 days)\n- Enhanced error handling with specific IAM permission messages\n- All 13 unit tests passing\n\n## Security Features\n- Buckets created with encryption by default\n- All public access blocked automatically\n- Versioning enabled for accidental deletion recovery\n- Lifecycle policies reduce storage costs\n- Graceful handling of concurrent bucket creation\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"acacc30aab814de4f076040e1605097217769642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/acacc30aab814de4f076040e1605097217769642"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDc2ODMzN2ZkOWY1MTQ5YmQ0Mzk3NGEyZGFiZWZlNGQxM2JmNTk4OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95","sha":"688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95"}],"sha":"768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/768337fd9f5149bd43974a2dabefe4d13bf59896"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T15:17:02Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T15:17:02Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Fix gRPC response parsing to extract actual message content\n\n- Parse gRPC result JSON to extract data.response field\n- Send only the actual message content to frontend instead of full JSON structure\n- Add fallback handling if parsing fails\n- Fixes chat display showing raw JSON instead of formatted messages","tree":{"sha":"3431da50e6405f8cadeeb375f321fdee1ce67a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/3431da50e6405f8cadeeb375f321fdee1ce67a0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDY4OGNjMmQzZmUxYjMyNDkxZjYwN2MzYjhhODhiYjUxMjg4NTlmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66","sha":"ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66"}],"sha":"688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/688cc2d3fe1b32491f607c3b8a88bb5128859f95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T14:38:53Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T14:38:53Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Fix gRPC A2A path routing with PathAwareChannel and channelOverride\n\nProblem:\n- Interceptors run too late - path is already set\n- @grpc/grpc-js doesn''t support path prefixes natively\n\nSolution:\n- Extend grpc.Channel to override createCall() method\n- Prepend A2A path prefix in createCall()\n- Use channelOverride client option\n\nBased on grpc/grpc-node#980 solution\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f664a677a38b8fc11fec9fad1f700e32e57ceab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/8f664a677a38b8fc11fec9fad1f700e32e57ceab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKGVlM2IxZjAzMTEwZjRkNmYxODk5MjE4NGM3NWY1NzEyMjc5ZDNiNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/471800ff1c3dc7b2f1300e0e015795ca607d14e7","sha":"471800ff1c3dc7b2f1300e0e015795ca607d14e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/471800ff1c3dc7b2f1300e0e015795ca607d14e7"}],"sha":"ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/ee3b1f03110f4d6f18992184c75f5712279d3b66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/471800ff1c3dc7b2f1300e0e015795ca607d14e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T14:22:51Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T14:22:51Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Add gRPC channel options matching Python client\n\nAdded channel options from talk_to_agent.py:\n- grpc.dns_resolver: native (for better DNS compatibility)\n- grpc.ssl_target_name_override: par.pixell.global\n- grpc.default_authority: par.pixell.global\n\nThese options match the Python reference implementation, but\nHTTP 464 error persists. Further investigation needed.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d82419ff28a4163449276f7de6c1d17ecb371cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/d82419ff28a4163449276f7de6c1d17ecb371cf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/471800ff1c3dc7b2f1300e0e015795ca607d14e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsign