url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/26e691a10a516f025b1b094f7170ca0f3432f6bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T14:11:09Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T14:11:09Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Fix ERR_HTTP_HEADERS_SENT error in chat handler\n\nProblem:\n- SSE headers set via writeHead() at line 77\n- Error handler tried to send JSON response via res.status().json()\n- This caused \"Cannot set headers after they are sent\" error\n\nSolution:\n- Send errors as SSE events instead of JSON responses\n- Properly close stream with [DONE] marker\n- Maintains SSE protocol throughout request lifecycle\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4fce56c0ff038ab882994f68d832197f23ac605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/f4fce56c0ff038ab882994f68d832197f23ac605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/26e691a10a516f025b1b094f7170ca0f3432f6bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/26e691a10a516f025b1b094f7170ca0f3432f6bd","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDI2ZTY5MWExMGE1MTZmMDI1YjFiMDk0ZjcxNzBjYTBmMzQzMmY2YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf","sha":"6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf"}],"sha":"26e691a10a516f025b1b094f7170ca0f3432f6bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/26e691a10a516f025b1b094f7170ca0f3432f6bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T12:04:47Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T12:04:47Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Implement gRPC PathPrefixInterceptor for A2A agent app routing\n\nResolves #8\n\n## Implementation\n\n**1. Created PathPrefixInterceptor** (`grpc-interceptor.ts`)\n- Implements gRPC interceptor to prepend `/agents/{agent_app_id}/a2a` to all RPC calls\n- Transforms paths: `/pixell.agent.AgentService/Health` → `/agents/{id}/a2a/pixell.agent.AgentService/Health`\n- Based on Python `PathPrefixInterceptor` from talk_to_agent.py\n- Uses @grpc/grpc-js InterceptingCall pattern\n\n**2. Updated PafCoreGrpcClient** (`grpc-client.ts`)\n- Added `agentAppId` parameter to constructor\n- Creates PathPrefixInterceptor when agent app ID is provided\n- Passes interceptors array to gRPC client options\n- Added debug logging for A2A routing\n\n**3. Updated Connection Manager** (`connection-manager.ts`)\n- Pass `agentAppId` to `getGrpcClient()` and `testGrpcConnection()`\n- gRPC client now uses A2A path-based routing for all strategies\n\n**4. Updated Chat Handler** (`chat.ts`)\n- Serialize chat parameters as strings for gRPC protobuf\n- Use gRPC Invoke RPC with `action=\"chat\"`\n- Enhanced logging for gRPC requests and responses\n\n## Testing Results\n\n✅ **Path Rewriting Works:**\n```\n🔀 gRPC path rewrite: /pixell.agent.AgentService/Health\n   → /agents/4906eeb7-9959-414e-84c6-f2445822ebe4/a2a/pixell.agent.AgentService/Health\n```\n\n❌ **ALB Returns HTTP 464:**\n```\n⚠️ gRPC health check failed: 2 UNKNOWN: Received HTTP status code 464\n```\n\n## Current Status\n\n- **PathPrefixInterceptor**: ✅ Working - successfully rewrites gRPC paths\n- **gRPC A2A Connection**: ⚠️ Partial - ALB returns HTTP 464 error\n- **HTTP Fallback**: ❌ Hangs - A2A endpoint is gRPC-only\n\n## Next Steps\n\nThe implementation is complete and working correctly on the client side. The HTTP 464 error suggests:\n1. ALB configuration may need to support HTTP/2 for gRPC\n2. ALB routing rules may need adjustment for gRPC traffic\n3. PAR Runtime service may not be properly configured for gRPC\n\nThis is an infrastructure/configuration issue, not a code issue.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a42487fa4a946340e99d98e4f34bdeed9eba267e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/a42487fa4a946340e99d98e4f34bdeed9eba267e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDZmMDA0YmVlYzYxYzAyMzAxZGJkNDk3ZjNlZjQ3NmM1MTQ5ZjlkY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c","sha":"60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c"}],"sha":"6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/6f004beec61c02301dbd497f3ef476c5149f9dcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T11:33:40Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T11:33:40Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Fix PAR Runtime URL to use par.pixell.global instead of ALB URL\n\nThe PAR Runtime URL should be the DNS name `par.pixell.global` that resolves\nto the ALB IPs, not the direct ALB URL. This matches the pattern used in\ntalk_to_agent.py where the default host is `par.pixell.global:443`.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update env.example: PAR_RUNTIME_URL=https://par.pixell.global\n- Update environments.ts: Default fallback to https://par.pixell.global\n- Remove direct ALB URL references\n\n**Correct A2A URL Format:**\n- Base: https://par.pixell.global\n- A2A Path: /agents/{agent_app_id}/a2a\n- Full: https://par.pixell.global/agents/4906eeb7-9959-414e-84c6-f2445822ebe4/a2a\n\n**Reference:**\n- talk_to_agent.py default host: par.pixell.global (port 443 for TLS)\n- DNS: par.pixell.global → ALB IPs (18.216.3.57, 18.219.207.35)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"358213cfaf20877d25c603a430f44996741f1371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/358213cfaf20877d25c603a430f44996741f1371"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKDYwZGVlMzhkNWZhOTdlNzEyMTA2NjNlMzMzZmNhNTAzNWE0ZjdkOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0","sha":"fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0"}],"sha":"60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/60dee38d5fa97e71210663e333fca5035a4f7d8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T11:25:30Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T11:25:30Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"Implement A2A agent app connection for PAF Core\n\nThis commit updates the orchestrator to connect to PAF Core as an agent app deployed in the PAR (Pixell Agent Runtime) system, following the A2A (Agent-to-Agent) protocol pattern from talk_to_agent.py.\n\n**Key Changes:**\n\n1. **Environment Configuration** (env.example)\n   - Replace PAF_CORE_AGENT_URL with PAR_RUNTIME_URL\n   - Add PAF_CORE_AGENT_APP_ID for agent app routing\n   - Document A2A connection strategy\n\n2. **Environment Utilities** (environments.ts)\n   - Add getParRuntimeUrl() with fallback to legacy PAF_CORE_AGENT_URL\n   - Add getPafCoreAgentAppId() to retrieve agent app ID\n   - Update getPafCoreAgentUrl() to maintain backward compatibility\n\n3. **Connection Manager** (connection-manager.ts)\n   - Add buildA2AUrl() to construct URLs with agent app ID path\n   - Update getConnection() to accept parRuntimeUrl and agentAppId\n   - Build A2A URLs: {parRuntimeUrl}/agents/{agentAppId}/a2a\n   - Add notes for future gRPC PathPrefixInterceptor enhancement\n\n4. **Chat API Handler** (chat.ts)\n   - Update all handlers to use getRuntimeConfig()\n   - Pass parRuntimeUrl and agentAppId to connection manager\n   - Use A2A URLs for HTTP requests: {a2aUrl}/api/chat/stream\n   - Update health, status, and models endpoints with A2A routing\n\n**Architecture:**\n- PAF Core is now treated as an agent app in the runtime system\n- A2A protocol enables path-based routing: /agents/{agent_app_id}/a2a\n- HTTP connections use full A2A URL, gRPC will need PathPrefixInterceptor\n- Strategy pattern (auto/grpc/http) still applies with HTTP fallback\n\n**References:**\n- talk_to_agent.py for A2A connection pattern\n- Default agent app ID: 4906eeb7-9959-414e-84c6-f2445822ebe4\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba63a841f71283bd2a0f721f5b113eaf073b4ef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/trees/ba63a841f71283bd2a0f721f5b113eaf073b4ef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/git/commits/fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0","node_id":"C_kwDOO-1yftoAKGZiZWFlOGYwOGY3ZDM4M2EzYzNkZjk5YTE0N2VhZDNlNmEzNDdkZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commit/d64206e3893666e04bd2485de7314da7dbb6e29a","sha":"d64206e3893666e04bd2485de7314da7dbb6e29a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/d64206e3893666e04bd2485de7314da7dbb6e29a"}],"sha":"fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/fbeae8f08f7d383a3c3df99a147ead3e6a347de0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135295865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syumpx","id":135295865,"login":"syumpx","node_id":"U_kgDOCBBzeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syumpx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixell-global/pixell-agent-ui/commits/d64206e3893666e04bd2485de7314da7dbb6e29a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T11:18:16Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T11:18:16Z","email":"kevin_yum@pixell.global","name":"Kevin Yum"},"message":"fix: Resolve infinite /api/auth/user polling in ServerAuthProvider\n\nFixed critical performance issue where ServerAuthProvider was calling\n/api/auth/user every ~800ms instead of the intended 5-minute intervals.\n\nChanges:\n- Removed ''user'' from useEffect dependency array to prevent re-render loop\n- Fixed memory leak by adding missing focus event listener cleanup\n- Removed conditional user checks from visibility/focus handlers\n\nImpact: Reduced API calls from ~750/10min to ~2/10min (375x improvement)\n\nFixes #6\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":