vacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Cliffback","id":51080320,"login":"Cliffback","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgwMzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cliffback","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cliffback/stencil-custom-suffix-output-target/commits/17392408578c7443a416ce62e0818f6a337d0cee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:59:31Z","email":"51080320+Cliffback@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Mathias Eek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:12:18Z","email":"51080320+Cliffback@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Mathias Eek"},"message":"fix: skip components whose files cannot be read (#48)\n\nIn dev mode, Stencil''s compilerCtx.fs.readFile() can resolve with\nundefined instead of rejecting when a file doesn''t exist. The previous\n.catch only handled rejections, so undefined content was\npassed to ts.createSourceFile(), crashing with:\n\n  TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''length'')\n\nNormalize both catch paths to return undefined and skip components\nwhose output files are not yet available, instead of transforming\nempty/undefined content.","tree":{"sha":"8169eaa2b6d9fe8c4c87ef701069cf9692d91b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cliffback/stencil-custom-suffix-output-target/git/trees/8169eaa2b6d9fe8c4c87ef701069cf9692d91b39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cliffback/stencil-custom-suffix-output-target/git/commits/17392408578c7443a416ce62e0818f6a337d0cee","verification":{"payload":"tree 8169eaa2b6d9fe8c4c87ef701069cf9692d91b39\nparent cd68d1cc8ca4487ff04b1b0abaf652bdce5fd51c\nauthor Mathias Eek <51080320+Cliffback@users.noreply.github.com> 1786006771 +0200\ncommitter Mathias Eek <51080320+Cliffback@users.noreply.github.com> 1786007538 +0200\n\nfix: skip components whose files cannot be read (#48)\n\nIn dev mode, Stencil''s compilerCtx.fs.readFile() can resolve with\nundefined instead of rejecting when a file doesn''t exist. The previous\n.catch only handled rejections, so undefined content was\npassed to ts.createSourceFile(), crashing with:\n\n  TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''length'')\n\nNormalize both catch paths to return undefined and skip components\nwhose output files are not yet available, instead of transforming\nempty/undefined content.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEI6bDnBqnT8qC3vuA5SX/bkqGe68FAmp0UDIACgkQ5SX/bkqG\ne6/9vg//crsNK0fxO8+bBvVLybIMBfRxP+PIk6YTrLbh90i4q/Cq1cy2C4clUy/T\nawbqaexUUiWUC3aaifPu6WCxmVxNX7yDZwelCOOUeplWvXu2uYvyTw5nKpzpysN6\n/qS0DsHQ56HGoxAZogdEq7JbNFuoOhm882nwy6IvHRLdqE3lAuHHfH0pytT13BWf\n6hgCGnqNwjjpfCf22qR0u39OmKBozZ8mjEaLGHvsdoEhbr54PWJOWa+rN1a2hzOd\nKqMCRz5hyYmUlxzVpkSIjnxHCHpC0wmPaAluC98IP4mshbfHSd2aM8vvhKiawUs/\nT6eyQMwiTZMHnSdDLYKyN+X8LMBtDVeD7oF68iINQIve1P4IQ09Luqtpw5fX4n6z\ntbOFV0K9n3YekaY+8XYrIqL8L8mCl/l7L36/A/f6I+wF1XwHcvcPDgJhNLpnnhg8\n4dnqh6F6B2YsSlk5SwA8AB+ITiaLLO+P6RG/cdiP8D1xzhS5r2dc8Wzb2pDagF+0\nTz1uwR9/lpMwdacrYrT/KB5xd5NnCFPg23K5TPIgOnOW+6Ud1BwHOtUMggF3Dzya\n+xCTjH3L1Sibr2EJmmdZ1GXv+TIDJF2NU621AsvXwPlmiWloKbJI4VDqU24J09T8\n0NB6beSI+w+Q2Kju/tpkhER53ut+FHTYsIOwUGHnWocjlBeYmS0=\n=ikKz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-06T09:13:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51080320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users