anager/commits/832c6403ab136e9e900014748e94199b2c7c4828/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-25T10:41:15Z","email":"chrism@cdg.ws","name":"chrismckenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-25T10:41:15Z","email":"chrism@cdg.ws","name":"chrismckenna"},"message":"feat: Add configurable environment support for development/production modes\n\n- Added getEnvironment() function to determine current environment\n- Environment can be configured via CLI (--env), env vars, config files, or .env\n- Development mode: No sudo required, runs git/composer/npm directly\n- Production mode: Requires sudo, uses www-data user for proper permissions\n- Updated all root/permission checks to use environment-aware logic\n- Added environment configuration to setup wizard\n- Created .env.example and .ren360rc.example files for documentation\n- Updated help text to document new environment configuration options\n\nThis allows developers to use the tool without sudo on their local machines\nwhile maintaining proper permissions on production servers.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74654db70908b3fd4a32cc95c7ee904aeaae66fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/74654db70908b3fd4a32cc95c7ee904aeaae66fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/832c6403ab136e9e900014748e94199b2c7c4828","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/832c6403ab136e9e900014748e94199b2c7c4828","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDgzMmM2NDAzYWIxMzZlOWU5MDAwMTQ3NDhlOTQxOTliMmM3YzQ4Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/19341402dd021c9b93ac70663248cd8120249165","sha":"19341402dd021c9b93ac70663248cd8120249165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos