d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:27:16Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:27:16Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"fix: Fix AI agent API request format to handle system prompt correctly","tree":{"sha":"0044bd874da03c251cc17cb07828ad9ccd4782f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/0044bd874da03c251cc17cb07828ad9ccd4782f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/9f58505cb91c1ef14019ad0665768c951e55893d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/9f58505cb91c1ef14019ad0665768c951e55893d","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDlmNTg1MDVjYjkxYzFlZjE0MDE5YWQwNjY1NzY4Yzk1MWU1NTg5M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c","sha":"7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c"}],"sha":"9f58505cb91c1ef14019ad0665768c951e55893d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/9f58505cb91c1ef14019ad0665768c951e55893d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:24:14Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:24:14Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add integrated AI agent with Anthropic Claude for PR analysis\n\nMajor AI Integration Features:\n- Built-in AI agent using Anthropic''s Claude API\n- Interactive setup command: node repo-manager.js setup-ai\n- Automated PR analysis with --analyze flag\n\nSetup:\n1. Run: node repo-manager.js setup-ai\n2. Enter your Anthropic API key\n3. Choose your preferred model (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku)\n4. Test automatically runs to verify configuration\n\nAI Analysis Includes:\n- Security vulnerability detection\n- Code quality assessment\n- Performance optimization suggestions\n- Test case recommendations\n- Architecture and design review\n- Breaking change detection\n\nNew Files:\n- lib/ai-agent.js: AI agent implementation\n- .env.example: Configuration template\n- AI-README.md: Comprehensive documentation\n- .gitignore: Excludes .env files\n\nThe AI agent integrates seamlessly with the review command:\n  node repo-manager.js review 1234 --analyze\n\nThis eliminates the need for external tools - PR analysis happens\ndirectly within the repo-manager\\!\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c76029fc97af326003aa85ab7076a569be40ae77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/c76029fc97af326003aa85ab7076a569be40ae77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDc3NTVkNDFlY2U0ODZiM2FjZjIxZjAwNmQ5M2Q5MzQyMGVkYzcyOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b","sha":"dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b"}],"sha":"7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7755d41ece486b3acf21f006d93d93420edc729c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:19:48Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:19:48Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add PR review command with AI analysis capability\n\nNew ''review'' command finds all PRs across repos by ticket number:\n- node repo-manager.js review 1234\n- Shows all PRs for REN-1234 across all services\n- Displays status, author, files changed, reviews\n- Summarizes total changes and affected services\n\nAI Analysis Integration:\n- Use --analyze flag to generate AI prompt\n- Creates comprehensive analysis request with:\n  - Code quality assessment\n  - Security vulnerability checks\n  - Performance considerations\n  - Testing suggestions\n  - Architecture review\n- Saves prompt to /tmp/pr-analysis-<ticket>.txt\n\nAdded pr-ai-analyzer.js for enhanced AI integration:\n- Generates detailed review prompts\n- Includes severity ratings and checklists\n- Supports multiple AI tools (Claude, ChatGPT, GitHub Copilot)\n- Provides quick non-AI summary\n\nThis solves the problem of jumping between repos to find PRs\\!\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fba7ea0025bfbd6f82d48d7c7075485a7a0ebf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/1fba7ea0025bfbd6f82d48d7c7075485a7a0ebf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKGRjNGU2ODY5MzMyZTg3ODhmYzJlODllZGI4Njg2MTBlODg0ZDI3OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3","sha":"7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3"}],"sha":"dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/dc4e6869332e8788fc2e89edb868610e884d279b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:13:20Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:13:20Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add 5 powerful new commands - sync, search, recent, stash, and pr\n\nNew Commands:\n1. sync/pull - Pull latest changes on current branches\n   - node repo-manager.js sync [service]\n   - Checks for uncommitted changes before pulling\n\n2. search - Search for patterns across all repos\n   - node repo-manager.js search <pattern> [service] [--include=glob]\n   - Uses ripgrep for fast searching\n   - Shows match counts and file locations\n\n3. recent/activity - Show recent commits\n   - node repo-manager.js recent [service] [--days=N] [--count=N]\n   - Default shows last 7 days, 5 commits per service\n\n4. stash - Manage stashes across repos\n   - node repo-manager.js stash save \"message\"\n   - node repo-manager.js stash pop\n   - node repo-manager.js stash list\n\n5. pr - Create GitHub PRs from CLI\n   - node repo-manager.js pr --title=\"Title\" [--body=\"desc\"] [--draft]\n   - Automatically pushes branch if needed\n   - Uses GitHub CLI (gh command)\n\nAll commands support --verbose flag for detailed output\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c66c1a6675e0cfa6ac243099583048e969e89f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/5c66c1a6675e0cfa6ac243099583048e969e89f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDdmNWMxZTljYmE1Njg0Mjc4MmMyZWY1MDIwZmI5NDk3NTBlOTUzYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0","sha":"137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0"}],"sha":"7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7f5c1e9cba56842782c2ef5020fb949750e953b3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:05:46Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T06:05:46Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add status command to show repository health\n\n- Shows uncommitted files, commits ahead/behind for each service\n- Color-coded output: green for clean, yellow for attention, red for behind\n- Works for single service or all services\n- CLI: node repo-manager.js status [service]\n- Interactive menu: option 7\n- Helps identify which repos need attention before PRs\n\nStatus indicators:\n- ✓ clean: no changes, synced with remote\n- ⚠ X uncommitted: has uncommitted changes\n- ⚠ X ahead: has unpushed commits\n- ⚠ X behind: remote has newer commits\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ddd9f52493646108b85ac0c77b5be1908f8014a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/4ddd9f52493646108b85ac0c77b5be1908f8014a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDEzN2Q3YzYyODI5NmMwNTc5NDhkZTYzODhjYjE4NDQ2NmE3MzA0YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/b31dc1557ec9fdc19205a15944608785969f622c","sha":"b31dc1557ec9fdc19205a15944608785969f622c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/b31dc1557ec9fdc19205a15944608785969f622c"}],"sha":"137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/137d7c628296c057948de6388cb184466a7304b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/b31dc1557ec9fdc19205a15944608785969f622c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:52:20Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"co