"name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add clean output mode with --verbose flag for detailed logs\n\n- Default output now shows only service names with checkmarks (✓) or X (✗)\n- Summary always shows at the end\n- Added --verbose/-v flag to show detailed output\n- Much cleaner output for quick branch switches\n- Verbose mode shows all git commands and progress messages\n\nExample output (default):\n  frontend... ✓\n  emails... ✓\n  ads... ✗\n\nExample with --verbose shows full details like before\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73ec5af39d377282267cfd7f1b19f1d2bd9c6b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/73ec5af39d377282267cfd7f1b19f1d2bd9c6b69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/4f751095f890b5dc04f7caadc98af577651e60a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/4f751095f890b5dc04f7caadc98af577651e60a0","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDRmNzUxMDk1Zjg5MGI1ZGMwNGY3Y2FhZGM5OGFmNTc3NjUxZTYwYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa","sha":"f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa"}],"sha":"4f751095f890b5dc04f7caadc98af577651e60a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/4f751095f890b5dc04f7caadc98af577651e60a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:38:09Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:38:09Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add --skip-deps flag to skip dependency installation\n\n- Added --skip-deps flag to update command\n- Skips composer/npm install when switching branches\n- Useful for quick branch switches when dependencies haven''t changed\n- Significantly speeds up branch switching\n\nUsage:\n  sudo node repo-manager.js update dev --skip-deps\n  sudo node repo-manager.js update REN-1234 frontend --skip-deps\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e045a8f500f0b3724b356869c7649dc66e80b5e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/e045a8f500f0b3724b356869c7649dc66e80b5e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKGY4MTcxZjJiY2E2YzEyYzc0NWVlZGUwNzJlZDhhYjkzM2ZhMzNjZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936","sha":"421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936"}],"sha":"f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/f8171f2bca6c12c745eede072ed8ab933fa33cfa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:32:38Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:32:38Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"feat: Add branch creation feature for REN-<ticket> workflow\n\n- Added createBranch function to create new branches from dev\n- Branches follow REN-<ticketnumber> naming convention\n- Supports creating branches for single service or all services\n- Added CLI command: repo-manager.js create <ticket> [service]\n- Added interactive menu option 6 for branch creation\n- Automatically checks out dev, pulls latest, then creates new branch\n- Handles case where branch already exists by checking it out\n\nUsage examples:\n  sudo node repo-manager.js create 1234      # Create REN-1234 for all services\n  sudo node repo-manager.js create 1234 frontend  # Create REN-1234 only for frontend\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de62344d758135ebd6b1c366c9b8103d0154ab68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/de62344d758135ebd6b1c366c9b8103d0154ab68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDQyMTE5MTgyNmFhMTQ3Yjk5ZDAzOTM4Y2YwNTIxMGRiMDI4ZDg5MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119","sha":"04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119"}],"sha":"421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/421191826aa147b99d03938cf05210db028d8936"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:13:20Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:13:20Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"fix: Correct PHP versions for each service based on deployment scripts\n\n- Analyzed all deployment scripts in /var/amarki/ to determine correct PHP versions\n- PHP 8.2 services: emails, frontend, integrations, sms, templates\n- PHP 8.1 services: ads, social\n- Default PHP services: users, images\n- Copied original deployment scripts to org-scripts/ for reference\n- Fixed composer dependency installation failures due to PHP version mismatches\n\nThis ensures each service uses the exact same PHP version as production deployments.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06b66239960b29abf99938871084908eb5be49e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/06b66239960b29abf99938871084908eb5be49e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDA0ZjU2Y2EwYWYwOGM3NzZkY2NlMjRkZTRjZTE2N2E1OTYzOTUxMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392","sha":"53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392"}],"sha":"04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/04f56ca0af08c776dcce24de4ce167a596395119"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:03:44Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T05:03:44Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"fix: Use full paths to PHP and composer binaries based on deployment scripts\n\n- Match the exact composer commands from /var/amarki/ shell scripts\n- PHP 8.1 services: Use /usr/bin/php8.1 /usr/local/bin/composer26\n- PHP 8.2 (frontend): Use /usr/bin/php8.2 /usr/local/bin/composer26\n- PHP 7.4 (users, images): Use default composer command\n- Remove intelligence from PHP services (it''s Node.js only)\n- Add support for composer update with --composer-update flag\n\nThis fixes the composer version issues encountered during branch updates.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30c697ee7fdc75cee6d7e5d8f2c5cababa76fd36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/30c697ee7fdc75cee6d7e5d8f2c5cababa76fd36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDUzMzE4YWQwNWQ4YTY3N2RkOGY4YjVhZWY2YjhiMjBlYWEwZTgzOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/7df423f95367753cfbf2657c03bf140f2c6e079d","sha":"7df423f95367753cfbf2657c03bf140f2c6e079d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7df423f95367753cfbf2657c03bf140f2c6e079d"}],"sha":"53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/53318ad05d8a677dd8f8b5aef6b8b20eaa0e8392"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commits/7df423f95367753cfbf2657c03bf140f2c6e079d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-21T04:22:45Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-21T04:22:45Z","email":"cmckenna@ip-172-31-6-121.us-east-2.compute.internal","name":"Christopher McKenna"},"message":"fix: Add full path to composer for PHP 8.1 services\n\nFixed composer install failures for PHP 8.1 services (ads, emails, integrations, sms, social, templates) by adding the full path to the composer executable (/usr/local/bin/composer).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"07866476f8a9bdda429a65a9de27b97d13803cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/trees/07866476f8a9bdda429a65a9de27b97d13803cb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/git/commits/7df423f95367753cfbf2657c03bf140f2c6e079d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360-repo-manager/commit/7df423f95367753cfbf2657c03bf140f2c6e079d","node_id":"C_kwDOO_TdyNoAKDdkZjQyM2Y5NTM2Nzc1M2NmYmYyNjU3YzAzYmYxNDBmMmM2ZTA3OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/topher-ren360/ren360