sage":"Fix frontend Dockerfile bun base image and add CI test pipeline (#20)\n\n* fix: use oven/bun base image in frontend Dockerfile and add CI pipeline\n\n- Replace node:22 with oven/bun:1 in frontend/Dockerfile.dev so bun is available\n- Add GHA layer cache config to docker-compose.yml for backend and frontend\n- Mark .env as optional in docker-compose.yml to support CI without local secrets\n- Add .github/workflows/test_pr.yml with parallel build and test jobs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address code review issues in CI pipeline\n\n- Pass ACCESS_LIFETIME and REFRESH_LIFETIME to backend container via\n  docker-compose.yml environment block with variable substitution and defaults\n- Add 30-attempt bounded timeout to postgres healthcheck loop\n- Pin GHA runner to ubuntu-24.04 instead of ubuntu-latest\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* pytest step\n\n* pytest step\n\n* pytest step\n\n* gitignore\n\n* finally\n\n* configure testing\n\n* fixed tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ac39902ee86b0a224db6f325999879213fe9dde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/git/trees/0ac39902ee86b0a224db6f325999879213fe9dde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/git/commits/2ba442b1f2327791cf66333a42beb13ae40b0ffc","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ac39902ee86b0a224db6f325999879213fe9dde\nparent 837d961ff006fadecbab777a98940cf735ef0734\nauthor Andres Gomez <30700328+andresgoag@users.noreply.github.com> 1776959354 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776959354 -0500\n\nFix frontend Dockerfile bun base image and add CI test pipeline (#20)\n\n* fix: use oven/bun base image in frontend Dockerfile and add CI pipeline\n\n- Replace node:22 with oven/bun:1 in frontend/Dockerfile.dev so bun is available\n- Add GHA layer cache config to docker-compose.yml for backend and frontend\n- Mark .env as optional in docker-compose.yml to support CI without local secrets\n- Add .github/workflows/test_pr.yml with parallel build and test jobs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address code review issues in CI pipeline\n\n- Pass ACCESS_LIFETIME and REFRESH_LIFETIME to backend container via\n  docker-compose.yml environment block with variable substitution and defaults\n- Add 30-attempt bounded timeout to postgres healthcheck loop\n- Pin GHA runner to ubuntu-24.04 instead of ubuntu-latest\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* pytest step\n\n* pytest step\n\n* pytest step\n\n* gitignore\n\n* finally\n\n* configure testing\n\n* fixed tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp6j96CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuBoQAEaz9BCMtA7DhYXV76WDXAOT\nKuLvFJyQ6NWmpYWsbBhQ/Szm//rw5NmpA0Tszyikd9nVRJeKKDTe3CKJPpMsKi7h\nbW2ZH0/el858iKEq2fNNcsXJbcvOaARw6Lr2Zc+CkZZK+pxu9qUciCxreTxTCZb/\ngX4Yaqicp4+8TsVQBeZGsJu0L2OFU+spMfDU3wN1SxwkB3THotnn8OvFri3efeBa\nBCXO815ebANXJqtxnQgia+KrrWorXsWDZ5Ke60eU/nQwskV8GxjAUmhscB4Iqdfe\nCfgG08wFuhU1BxVr0AGw2wkuumVyUncgHySZizNRwkjvgPNRUFC4E217fugNaW2y\nPshgY/bcoHmTwNuAsYZSsMZs7Hqgo51xsLCPgYjISwndJptsbinlgIYUXrte2XHd\nZZada/OHy4HFONir1Q4GEx8gomLqHrGBVhMP/ceN2Nw2WOwJ1iumcujVVgXuGev+\nzfcwDYLQx0iBRsDj+tgqogw++JFbEnhsVajGTCjXhnzmSyZvfYql17aXKmxfYYzC\nNJkKydw0jmtvB3T8Fi/ud9aD8SOKQaCWbjdn4xdjBriLTV+aiTeIDtmH1GZlczCd\nw4v59qZXm+ZgWoqu69UzvSrE8dXyjTZNy+KPBaI3nZHG0wMKEP3ulrsICbF+nX1r\noPXnvR8bVtnBvlQw2jf4\n=ePml\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T15:49:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andresgoag/base_fullstack/commit/2ba442b1f2327791cf66333a42beb13ae40b0ffc","node_id":"C_kwDOPAt8m9oAKDJiYTQ0MmIxZjIzMjc3OTFjZjY2MzMzYTQyYmViMTNhZTQwYjBmZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andresgoag/base_fullstack/commit/837d961ff006fadecbab777a98940cf735ef0734","sha":"837d961ff006fadecbab777a98940cf735ef0734","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/commits/837d961ff006fadecbab777a98940cf735ef0734"}],"sha":"2ba442b1f2327791cf66333a42beb13ae40b0ffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/commits/2ba442b1f2327791cf66333a42beb13ae40b0ffc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30700328?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andresgoag","id":30700328,"login":"andresgoag","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzAwMzI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/commits/837d961ff006fadecbab777a98940cf735ef0734/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T18:28:27Z","email":"30700328+andresgoag@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Andres Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T18:28:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update Django to 6.0.2 and Vite to 7.3.1 (#14)\n\n* add implementation plan for Django and Vite updates\n\nPlan targets Django 6.0.2 and Vite 7.3.1 with comprehensive compatibility\nanalysis and testing strategy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* update Django to 6.0.2 and Vite to 7.3.1\n\nBackend updates:\n- Django: 5.2.3 → 6.0.2 (security fixes)\n- Updated uv.lock with compatible Django ecosystem packages\n\nFrontend updates:\n- Vite: 6.3.5 → 7.3.1\n- @vitejs/plugin-react: 4.4.1 → 5.1.4\n- Updated bun.lock\n\nDocumentation:\n- Updated CLAUDE.md with new version references\n\nAll dependency resolution completed successfully. Frontend build\nand linting verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* address code review feedback\n\nCritical fixes:\n- Update Django 5.2 references to 6.0 in settings.py comments\n- Fix frontend Dockerfile.dev to use bun instead of npm\n\nImportant fixes:\n- Constrain Django version to <7.0 to prevent auto-upgrades\n- Update CLAUDE.md to reflect \"Django 6.0.2+\" constraint\n- Update uv.lock after version constraint change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* solved comments\n\n* revert Django to version 5.2 for better ecosystem compatibility\n\n- Downgrade Django from 6.0.2 to 5.2.11 (latest 5.2.x with security patches)\n- Update version constraint to >=5.2.3,<6.0 to stay on 5.2 series\n- Update settings.py documentation URLs from 6.0 to 5.2\n- Update CLAUDE.md to reflect Django 5.2+\n\nThis ensures better compatibility with Django REST Framework, Djoser,\nand SimpleJWT which have explicit support for Django 5.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f53374ab7445e2561970735ad5afb5863971968e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/git/trees/f53374ab7445e2561970735ad5afb5863971968e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/git/commits/837d961ff006fadecbab777a98940cf735ef0734","verification":{"payload":"tree f53374ab7445e2561970735ad5afb5863971968e\nparent afbb6fc375deda16a977b27c26c0932ea73ccb3c\nauthor Andres Gomez <30700328+andresgoag@users.noreply.github.com> 1771093707 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771093707 -0500\n\nUpdate Django to 6.0.2 and Vite to 7.3.1 (#14)\n\n* add implementation plan for Django and Vite updates\n\nPlan targets Django 6.0.2 and Vite 7.3.1 with comprehensive compatibility\nanalysis and testing strategy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* update Django to 6.0.2 and Vite to 7.3.1\n\nBackend updates:\n- Django: 5.2.3 → 6.0.2 (security fixes)\n- Updated uv.lock with compatible Django ecosystem packages\n\nFrontend updates:\n- Vite: 6.3.5 → 7.3.1\n- @vitejs/plugin-react: 4.4.1 → 5.1.4\n- Updated bun.lock\n\nDocumentation:\n- Updated CLAUDE.md with new version references\n\nAll dependency resolution completed successfully. Frontend build\nand linting verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* address code review feedback\n\nCritical fixes:\n- Update Django 5.2 references to 6.0 in settings.py comments\n- Fix frontend Dockerfile.dev to use bun instead of npm\n\nImportant fixes:\n- Constrain Django version to <7.0 to prevent auto-upgrades\n- Update CLAUDE.md to reflect \"Django 6.0.2+\" constraint\n- Update uv.lock after version constraint change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* solved comments\n\n* revert Django to version 5.2 for better ecosystem compatibility\n\n- Downgrade Django from 6.0.2 to 5.2.11 (latest 5.2.x with security patches)\n- Update version constraint to >=5.2.3,<6.0 to stay on 5.2 series\n- Update settings.py documentation URLs from 6.0 to 5.2\n- Update CLAUDE.md to reflect Django 5.2+\n\nThis ensures better compatibility with Django REST Framework, Djoser,\nand SimpleJWT which have explicit support for Django 5.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpkL7LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGZoQAKPVqIYsksSlc67pUoCmlqlN\nMYWs3Lkesi2OacynZ8YO/u5VigjThEOnc+hmEt5yrIY9R6hu02KTzOMrjzvuitNX\n3rObkKn4Z9QzdK7Vx0se72XowKQ5v5OqdMJheigyi9tczIruNyvcjUCa3loLl97c\nBCrJtiNx5g/aJYg2VeQqOke9p8AFrTggbLEHebKqgjQnlp+McZsS1RqSbwW5GML4\nKth7AgDohDL6rtWEGZ+vL8L2uHVUv9z2Pk8cPEU1hAmuIETO58WCXkuSBTLpMqUe\nx/aFeD1sf/lx/B0OZ8Jb+ha95DFWFjeOGnPWbPIFMkiUIqzmeUKvDuqPsnyIKFE2\n3WbyiY2se0ArguJqN4ZjQjWCb3o2+lvi1nA7tDyF2TToLjEbJPByQV/Rf3ctu3Co\nypefeJsx12FX/n/Pf0yHnnXi//J1wSlRCsOFks8YKi/m2ICZAEqqNqwteQXHuUrn\nbdtnHsUeKWam1CsNGVJNAyTMSXe2YGxxoaDEJBiB1L8v5rw3Owl07Jjxd4fMEQFc\nEJGHE7kNGjOnhP3sxYdaGzh+sroK/sihkkq34DBTUTkVGTMt0huoDjZ4irHtdfJM\n5izu+6y60/PkEkMe1PwuvMRSdLICE1ehJX3Mf2Md1yX6NAyQpdO96UjoYwSQIXK2\ndA4haaIYnkLNxUFjSX0Y\n=5y7K\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-14T18:28:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist