arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andresgoag","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/commits/afbb6fc375deda16a977b27c26c0932ea73ccb3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T02:46:35Z","email":"30700328+andresgoag@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Andres Gomez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T02:46:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"update React to 19.2.4 and related dependencies (#12)\n\n* add implementation plan for React update to 19.2.4\n\nPlan outlines upgrading React from 19.1.0 to 19.2.4 with comprehensive testing strategy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* update React to 19.2.4 and related dependencies\n\nUpdated core React packages:\n- react: 19.1.0 → 19.2.4\n- react-dom: 19.1.0 → 19.2.4\n- @types/react: 19.1.2 → 19.2.13\n- @types/react-dom: 19.1.2 → 19.2.3\n\nUpdated ecosystem packages:\n- @tanstack/react-query: 5.80.7 → 5.90.20\n- react-router: 7.6.2 → 7.13.0\n- react-hook-form: 7.58.0 → 7.71.1\n- eslint-plugin-react-refresh: 0.4.19 → 0.4.26\n\nAll builds and linter checks pass successfully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix AuthContext dependency issues and apply formatting\n\nFixed critical useEffect dependency array issues in AuthContextProvider:\n- Removed unstable mutation functions (refreshAccess, getCurrentUser) from dependency arrays\n- Prevents infinite render loops and excessive API calls\n- Added eslint-disable comments for intentional dependency omissions\n\nApplied Prettier formatting to related files for consistency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2324432992b2eb525e5355e19708110f97a74fe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/git/trees/2324432992b2eb525e5355e19708110f97a74fe7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andresgoag/base_fullstack/git/commits/afbb6fc375deda16a977b27c26c0932ea73ccb3c","verification":{"payload":"tree 2324432992b2eb525e5355e19708110f97a74fe7\nparent 3f8ae3fc79f7989a9e3b2bac8823a2b5629c26f5\nauthor Andres Gomez <30700328+andresgoag@users.noreply.github.com> 1770864395 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770864395 -0500\n\nupdate React to 19.2.4 and related dependencies (#12)\n\n* add implementation plan for React update to 19.2.4\n\nPlan outlines upgrading React from 19.1.0 to 19.2.4 with comprehensive testing strategy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* update React to 19.2.4 and related dependencies\n\nUpdated core React packages:\n- react: 19.1.0 → 19.2.4\n- react-dom: 19.1.0 → 19.2.4\n- @types/react: 19.1.2 → 19.2.13\n- @types/react-dom: 19.1.2 → 19.2.3\n\nUpdated ecosystem packages:\n- @tanstack/react-query: 5.80.7 → 5.90.20\n- react-router: 7.6.2 → 7.13.0\n- react-hook-form: 7.58.0 → 7.71.1\n- eslint-plugin-react-refresh: 0.4.19 → 0.4.26\n\nAll builds and linter checks pass successfully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix AuthContext dependency issues and apply formatting\n\nFixed critical useEffect dependency array issues in AuthContextProvider:\n- Removed unstable mutation functions (refreshAccess, getCurrentUser) from dependency arrays\n- Prevents infinite render loops and excessive API calls\n- Added eslint-disable comments for intentional dependency omissions\n\nApplied Prettier formatting to related files for consistency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjT8LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAy90QAJWxoXnl39k2eRp54U640m1d\nhggFTkAUgn3pAmCdqKZGd7Fy9xmqMhmD0CbHUVNVl2vI2TyRrMO++u6vsJEq9TLv\nIfA3akW8RT2fHY7K